[C]Teri shirt da main ta [F]button soniye.. [C]soniye..(soniye)

Haye [C]teri shirt da main ta [F]button soniye..[G]baalon ka tere main haye [F]clip ho [C]gaya-[2 times]

[G]chand se bhi zyada sona

[F]mukhda [G]tera

Haye [G]dekhte hi dil ye [F]slip ho [C]gaya

{c: Chorus}

[C]Oo mar gaye [F]yaar deewane..

[C]Oo tere [F]lover purane

[C]Oo die hard [F]fan tere [G]hain tuhi [F]kadar na jaane..[C]-[2 times]

Teri shirt da main ta part repeat

